    </div>\n            <details class=\"group\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"technical summary disclosure\">\n                <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between py-1 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#d8dbe0]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"summary header\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"summary title\">\n                        Resumo técnico\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down text-[14px] text-[#969da6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"chevron icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"pt-1 text-[11px] leading-[1.5] text-[#9ea4ac]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"summary details\">\n                    Município, UF, zona UTM e área serão informados após o carregamento válido da geometria.\n                </p>\n            </details>\n            <div class=\"my-3 h-px bg-white/[0.08]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-6\" data-name=\"separator line\">\n            </div>\n            <details data-kid=\"1-2-3-7\" data-name=\"technical register disclosure\">\n                <summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between py-1 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#d8dbe0]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-7-1\" data-name=\"register header\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-7-1-1\" data-name=\"register title\">\n                        Registro técnico\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down text-[14px] text-[#969da6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-7-1-2\" data-name=\"chevron icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"pt-1 text-[11px] leading-[1.5] text-[#9ea4ac]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-7-2\" data-name=\"register details\">\n                    O registro de importação e geração ficará disponível durante a execução.\n                </p>\n            </details>\n            <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-white/[